[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0010","text":"辛苦了，甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0020","text":"嗯……\n是点心时间吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0030","text":"昵嘿嘿……\n嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0050","text":"……甜花？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0060","text":"……啊，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0070","text":"……甜花……\n今天的练习……失败了好多次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0080","text":"所、所以……\n小奈和千雪小姐……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0090","text":"跟我说加油，给了我……点心……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_01_0100","text":"──原来是这样啊"}]
